Package: xios-x11
Name: Xios Desktop (X11)
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Author: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Section: Desktop
Priority: optional
Depends: firmware (>= 16.5), xios-core, xwayland, xios-server, xauth
Recommends: x11-xvfb, tigervnc-standalone-server
MinimumOSVersion: 16.5.0
Description: the X11 flavor for Xios
 The classic X11 path: the original Xios X server for plain X11 apps, plus
 Xwayland so X11 clients can also run inside the GPU-accelerated iosc
 compositor. This is the compatibility flavor for software that predates
 Wayland or that you want to run against a bare X server.
 .
 Xvfb and the TigerVNC server are recommended alongside for headless and
 remote-display setups.
 .
 Needs iOS 16.5 or newer. Target profile: @REPO_PROFILE@.
